    "body": "Realized I didn't respond to this.\n\nIn general that text was kind of trying to give an informal idea for web developers. But the way it's doing so is bad and imprecise and can cause implementer confusion. This needs to be overhauled to be more precise and then maybe we can additionally say something like \"In general authors should expect roughly X behavior.\"\n",
